// What a trait component does. AC_TraitBase implements it with empty handlers; each trait component (a child of
// AC_TraitBase) writes its own `on Evaluate` / `on OnRemoved`. (Loom can't override a parent Blueprint's function, so the
// overridable hooks are an interface's.)
interface BPI_TraitBehaviour at /Game/Mods/WhiskerTraits/Behaviours/BPI_TraitBehaviour {
    // Called every EvaluateInterval while the whisker lives.
    fn Evaluate()
    // Called when the component goes away while the whisker lives on (trait behaviours switched off): undo your effects.
    fn OnRemoved()
}
